 \, this charming musical brings Charlie Brown\, Snoopy\, Lucy\, Linus\, an
 d the rest of the gang to life in a heartwarming celebration of friendship
 \, imagination\, and the joys of everyday life. This production will be pe
 rformed outdoors in a partially shaded area. Chair seating will be availab
 le\; however\, a reservation does not guarantee a chair. Audience members 
 are encouraged to bring a blanket or lawn chair for their comfort.\n\nSour
 ces: Vermont Public
