DESCRIPTION:The Calvin Coolidge State Historic Site’s resident farmer wi
 ll be on hand each Wednesday from June 10 to October 21 to demonstrate his
 toric farming tools and techniques. Visitors may witness such activities a
 s sheep shearing\, rye harvesting\, or cider pressing. In addition to bein
 g an excellent educator\, Farmer Fred is a renowned storyteller and is sur
 e to entertain. Calvin Coolidge State Historic Site Every week through Oct
  21\, 2026.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
